intern table (ct_register). Every (&T, &!T, Option<T>, Box<T>) type is
now keyed by (kind, inner_ty, inner_hash) and assigned a stable
ct_base()+id. Decode is O(1) table lookup; overflow by construction
impossible regardless of nesting depth.

