492/498 (6 pre-existing failures unchanged); gen2==gen3 (md5:
6310414aaba4e640b317c5c5a5fc6dd7); bundle errors 399→393 vs original
baseline; 65 false type-errors removed, 59 real type-errors uncovered
(pre-existing bugs in bundle code now correctly diagnosed).

