Bug report:
[ir] opt_cleanup: add missing Div,Panic effects + opcodes_equal stub

Sixteen ocp_* functions were missing Div and/or Panic in their effect
declarations. Added with Div, Panic to:
  ocp_mark_used, ocp_sweep, ocp_dce_once, ocp_dce,
  ocp_cse_invalidate_reg, ocp_cse, ocp_dedup_imm, ocp_copy_prop,
  ocp_dse, ocp_redundant_jump, ocp_dead_after_jump, ocp_dead_label,
  ocp_mul3_sr, ocp_licm, ocp_gvn, ocp_sink_loads,
  ocp_jump_to_return, ocp_compact_nops.

Also added local matches_opcode/opcodes_equal definitions so the
module-scoped file can resolve the flat-namespace dep from const_prop.sio.

Pre-existing ownership error (ocp_cse double &! borrow of ctx) is
unchanged — was masked by resolution errors before, not introduced here.
main.sio check still passes (exit 0).

