[ir,compiler] Sprint 89: Block P — add-sub/sub-add cancellation

ocp_const_fold gains four tracking arrays (as_valid/as_var_src/as_const_v/
as_is_add) that record partial-const add/sub instructions. When the inverse
op appears with the matching constant, the pair folds to IrCopy(x):
  (x + C) - C → IrCopy(x)
  (x - C) + C → IrCopy(x)
Commutative add tracking covers (C + x) - C as well.

T252-T257 (6 tests); total 257. Gate: 23/24 PASS, 0 FAIL, 1 NOT_RUN.
SOTA: LLVM InstCombineAddSub.cpp; Muchnick §12.2.

